                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8888ffc8-d699-3777-975c-4941145375e4",
                        "entry_id": "2204cf7c-19ec-3436-8a3a-600f711456a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. последователь какого-либо художественного, литературного, научного или иного направления, лишённый творческой оригинальности"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3750849-4bb8-4daa-8485-6e4715793664",
                                "sense_id": "8888ffc8-d699-3777-975c-4941145375e4",
                                "text": "Эпигоны представляли влеченье без огня и дара."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d139d5e-7d9e-4aee-afd4-100e92f0c3ad",
                                "sense_id": "8888ffc8-d699-3777-975c-4941145375e4",
                                "text": "Вследствие этого г-н Дюринг безнадежно тонет в такой идеологии, которая превращает его в эпигона того самого Гегеля, которого он обозвал «эпигоном»."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "78fcbf7b-5445-4b3a-843b-d2ca5e154642",
                        "source_entry_id": "2204cf7c-19ec-3436-8a3a-600f711456a7",
                        "source_sense_id": "8888ffc8-d699-3777-975c-4941145375e4",
                        "target_lang_word": "epigone",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "epigone",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e19f2865-1f67-3e51-8b75-82e9cd4ad1c4",
                                        "entry_id": "34dc7e6c-bf37-315b-8d79-70d71f690b3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A follower or disciple."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "074e3e8e-9e92-4d6b-a514-fca4859c39b8",
                                                "sense_id": "e19f2865-1f67-3e51-8b75-82e9cd4ad1c4",
                                                "text": "India is run by gerontocrats and epigones: grey hairs and groomed heirs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f35d7a9-3230-374e-b48f-d05f2771b706",
                                        "entry_id": "34dc7e6c-bf37-315b-8d79-70d71f690b3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An undistinguished or inferior imitator of a well known artist or their style."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6907fd9c-c27b-4ec3-ac47-3342a3a934f5",
                                                "sense_id": "2f35d7a9-3230-374e-b48f-d05f2771b706",
                                                "text": "While Shaler remained subordinate, he followed Agassiz’s intellectual lead, often with the epigone’s habit of exaggerating his master’s voice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a869383-4d75-4d5c-a100-bf5bc94c9438",
                                                "sense_id": "2f35d7a9-3230-374e-b48f-d05f2771b706",
                                                "text": "In another twist to the myth, his Head of Department, the ageless and loathsome Vermishank, was not a plodding epigone but an exceptional bio-thaumaturge."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3f0de688-1d67-4914-ae80-cc111c81a069",
                        "source_entry_id": "2204cf7c-19ec-3436-8a3a-600f711456a7",
                        "source_sense_id": "8888ffc8-d699-3777-975c-4941145375e4",
                        "target_lang_word": "imitator",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "imitator",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9813002d-587e-38bc-b135-6dd45e40c87b",
                                        "entry_id": "36bce7f4-91e3-3e2a-a9ac-a78da43aeb5d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who imitates or apes another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "621ae26d-4a79-499d-b81f-44c05387bef9",
                                                "sense_id": "9813002d-587e-38bc-b135-6dd45e40c87b",
                                                "text": "Chalk it up to the government’s revelations in recent years about UFOs, or maybe just the pendulum swinging back, again, after “The X-Files” inspired a host of imitators in the 1990s."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87bbe984-6007-45f7-9896-40c7f48b1f4a",
                                                "sense_id": "9813002d-587e-38bc-b135-6dd45e40c87b",
                                                "text": "Other far-right sites would gravitate to Epik. Among the first to announce its migration in early 2019 was BitChute, a YouTube imitator that had been blocked by PayPal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e2f9a813-f23d-4ff6-8c8c-7aaec908d756",
                        "source_entry_id": "2204cf7c-19ec-3436-8a3a-600f711456a7",
                        "source_sense_id": "8888ffc8-d699-3777-975c-4941145375e4",
